# IT-020-3 Images

Images in this folder are used in the CoCu documents for teaching (like Kitchen LV2 C01.txt sample). Sizes are adjusted for suitable display in notes (e.g. 480px width).

## CoCu 2: Computer System Maintenance

| Filename | Description | Source (download and save as filename) |
|----------|-------------|----------------------------------------|
| maintenance-compressed-air.jpg | Cleaning PC interior / compressed air | Run `download-images.ps1` or [Computer onderhoud.jpg](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Computer_onderhoud.jpg) |
| maintenance-thermal-paste.jpg | Thermal paste / CPU heatsink | Run `download-images.ps1` or [Thermal compound pl.jpg](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thermal_compound_pl.jpg) |
| maintenance-event-viewer.png | Event Viewer / diagnostics | Take a screenshot of Windows Event Viewer (eventvwr.msc), or use a diagram from [Microsoft Learn - Event logs](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/manage-monitor-event-logs/) |
| maintenance-report.png | Maintenance report example | Use a simple table or checklist screenshot; or create a sample report in Word/Excel and export as image. |

**Resizing in Obsidian:** Drag the image or use HTML e.g. `<img src="images/maintenance-compressed-air.png" width="480">`.

